# daqring additions, appended to raspberrypi3_defconfig.
#
# No external-toolchain override here, deliberately. The Bootlin
# armv7-eabihf toolchains require BR2_ARM_CPU_ARMV7A, but the Pi 3
# defconfig selects a Cortex-A53 (ARMv8). The option is therefore
# hidden, the toolchain choice silently falls back to
# BR2_TOOLCHAIN_EXTERNAL_CUSTOM with an empty path, and the build dies
# with "Cannot execute cross-compiler '/arm-linux-gcc'". Buildroot's
# internal toolchain always matches the target - slower, always right.

# 1 GB of RAM: two build jobs, not four.
BR2_JLEVEL=2

BR2_PACKAGE_DAQRING=y
BR2_ROOTFS_OVERLAY="$(BR2_EXTERNAL_DAQRING_PATH)/rootfs-overlay"
